Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,cut through the wind and make A stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,don't let the darkness\Nwin, just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone,\Nwe'll go where we all want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a flaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, uh, that I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My body will not heed my call!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you must consider how large I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Merely lifting my head\Nwill put me so high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all grown up and you're\Nstill scared of heights?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Warriors such as I fear nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop whining and\Nstart flying. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bother getting big if\Nyou're still going to be a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fly already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop pushing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to argue!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been gone long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido could be killing\Nour friends right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:02:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But my heart is unprepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the eyelids! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking down Kaido and\Nwe're doing it together, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Mountain. A
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,clever
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,defense I have a job to do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we'll defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to survive till he comes back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallowed Glacier Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a part of one and now you're\Nchallenging me as if you're its hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, you're an ogre, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll always be my child, and\Nyou'll always have my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else is just a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to take on something\Nthat can never belong to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But the samurai don't see you as an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't bring their\Napprovals away in a tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know a damn thing about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.94,0:05:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lived your whole\Nmiserable life on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've spent it all alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:06:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,scuttering about in the ceilings like a\Ncockroach without a friend to your knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't have friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a friend who gave me hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ethaneth, he's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead and lost, just like those\Nsamurai you grew close to years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.36,0:06:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny how everyone who's ever\Nbeen kind to you ends up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's so cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it's snowing, and now I'm starving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're there, ogre princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.26,0:08:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're hungry, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it before someone notices.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why did the commander\Nexecute him all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He was delivering food to the\Nogre princess and he got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He even brought her a blanket\Nbecause the weather's been so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So the princess is still on the run, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying she wants to be Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed them yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to educate my\Nchild, and they got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what they deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't learned your lesson now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what'll it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only thing you have in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You think those people from the\Nland of Wano are your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But they don't give a damn about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just a convenience to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll come to fear you in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You must rule people by force!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're an ogre's child!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans will never come to\Naccept someone like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That is your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.82,0:10:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.94,0:10:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost of God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray, you got this, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving! Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my intent!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way to Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward! Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon's true form is fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can keep this,\Nhe'll be there in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting off course! We gotta turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, move to the left! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And left is this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! One minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see anyone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw someone fighting way up top.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try to aim for\Nthe roof! The roof? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall take you there post-haste! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're way too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.64,0:12:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Down I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're turning the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.14,0:12:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you flying with your\Neyes closed or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be terrified if I could see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're flying the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kino's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you're low-y!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you pink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.62,0:13:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just open your eyes, Momo! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I got some debris stuck in them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:14:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for\Ncrashing into everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, Luffy! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Help yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some guts and look ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is their castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Third floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.49,0:14:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kinda was running wild in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying there's\Na second giant dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be! It's pink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase it down and find\Nout who it is! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is noisy down there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Linlin, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make that hag\Npay for all the repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rest yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My job's not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine swiftness. All right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he is we made it did we I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.70,0:15:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're up terribly high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find some place to land quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look there, on top of the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim straight for Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:15:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Define!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,White Serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack Calderon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The mehaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The mehaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe we've met, unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have work left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die till I become\Nking of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not be the one who\Nsaved Straw Hat from death!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Kozuki Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the man who will become\Nthe land of Wano Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This feeling? Who's been? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoying yourself, Otago?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is far too dangerous\Nfor a young girl like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master, but no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go and help everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We will do everything within\Nour power to keep Otama safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.94,0:19:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let her be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can do is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just sighted a mysterious dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's currently on the rooftop,\Nalongside young master Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's Yamato who was\Nholding off the commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.76,0:20:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The two dragons are picking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy was hiding in their cook car!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.88,0:20:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A pink dragon and an azure\Ndragon staring each other down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's someone on the dragon's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The pink dragon's identity is a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have no doubt, it is a deadly enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I look closer,\Nyou're a dragon, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Like my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could turn into\Na monster like he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I'd be of some use to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.48,0:21:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You grew up fast, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, this world\Nisn't big enough for two giant dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.18,0:21:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to breathe fire, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll breathe something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, breathe something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us try!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it like Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You act like it's normal\Nfor people to breathe fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.16,0:22:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.62,0:22:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm peaceful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to bite Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bite him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to show him what we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.78,0:23:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-tum elephant guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to bite Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.16,0:23:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll make\Ncertain both of you escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.60,0:23:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:23:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.18,0:24:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.32,0:24:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father was a fool of a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me your name, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Spineless brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.44,0:24:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.76,0:24:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.54,0:25:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you did to\Nthe land of Wano and its people!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.74,0:25:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you,\Nfather would be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.68,0:25:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother would be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.06,0:25:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stay out of this,\Nyou pathetic little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.24,0:25:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.70,0:25:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.10,0:26:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.40,0:26:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just call him Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.96,0:26:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That pink dragon is Lord Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.10,0:26:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Shogun is doing Wano proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.06,0:26:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know you have\Nthe power to hurt Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.82,0:26:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons bring thunderclouds, and\Nnow there are two dragons here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your precious moon is gone,\Nand not a moment too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.28,0:27:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had taken even one more attack, I\Nwould be kneeling in defeat right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.34,0:27:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But the power your Su-Long transformation\Ngrants you is a double-edged sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.28,0:27:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's left you with no\Nmore strength to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.08,0:27:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, his power went away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.38,0:27:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall come to your reign at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.18,0:27:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to wait your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon didn't betray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.74,0:27:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got lickety lucky, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.96,0:28:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a good run, but now it's\Nlickety lights out for you, boss cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.44,0:28:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.98,0:28:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.34,0:28:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who you just took a bite out of?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.62,0:28:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,An emperor of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.38,0:28:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything left in the\Nworld that can scare you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.62,0:28:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.54,0:28:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.86,0:28:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.32,0:28:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With your eyes open this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.12,0:29:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.34,0:29:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.62,0:29:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,is to stop Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.84,0:29:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Kaido, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.34,0:29:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.34,0:29:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolfie's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.66,0:29:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him the old war, my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.84,0:29:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.54,0:30:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.24,0:30:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real riot, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.56,0:30:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure likes to talk, Vic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.88,0:30:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.44,0:30:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And Momo, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.26,0:30:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.54,0:30:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He always keeps his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.68,0:30:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our Loopy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.72,0:30:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.84,0:30:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.10,0:30:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.96,0:30:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's finally time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.24,0:30:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.15,0:30:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.88,0:31:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you have even a\Nsingle chance of defeating me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.14,0:31:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm still alive,\NI have infinite chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.58,0:31:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.12,0:31:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.32,0:32:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like in the journal, Odin wrote about\Nthis when Roger and Whitebeard clashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.78,0:32:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He said the heavens split open.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.74,0:32:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.62,0:32:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds have split.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.62,0:32:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough from you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.56,0:32:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.50,0:32:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.76,0:32:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck sees me back on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.54,0:33:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're having a ball\Nup there, aren't you, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.82,0:33:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.18,0:33:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let our friends\Nshow us up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.30,0:33:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin, one sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Frenzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.92,0:34:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.60,0:34:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking that!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.60,0:34:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tear you apart, you Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.42,0:34:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,K-9 Cleaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.58,0:35:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro, I wish I could share I'll\Nshare one last drink with you, Karoo,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.44,0:35:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,under this beautiful moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.32,0:35:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.42,0:35:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.32,0:35:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are great!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.50,0:35:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.82,0:35:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a fine performance, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.74,0:35:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.34,0:35:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You Karoo did what none of us could!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.06,0:35:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro is a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.36,0:35:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.92,0:35:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.38,0:35:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon's still out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.02,0:35:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugara don't want to turn Sulong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.96,0:35:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what made the clouds clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.16,0:35:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Having some crazy weather\Ntonight, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.02,0:36:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know the rage of the meek people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.88,0:36:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.06,0:36:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They took down Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.98,0:36:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If they can stand up to a lead performer,\Nwho knows what else they're capable of?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.68,0:36:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.98,0:36:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it's none of my concern now.
